      "writtenOn": "2026-07-20T19:44:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not intentionaland it leads to different behavior between superprojects and non-superprojects which isn\u0027t ideal.  I\u0027m not sure if that\u0027s a showstopper.\n\nWhy do superprojects filter groups out of the re-written manifest?\n\nThe nice thing about this change is it was relatively minor. I see two ways out of this behavior:\n #1 - don\u0027t have superprojects filter groups out, I need to understand the implications of this.\n #2 - update this code to only sync the subset of groups from init, let me see if this can be done in a straightforward way.",
      "parentUuid": "053c0fa1_4c9184e7",
      "revId": "a97d7b1e2fef2f804cef273152da69cdc9bb50e8",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
